{"title":"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(interesting_property)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (interesting property)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Number_Craft_(🔥✅_Includes_important_concepts)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Number Craft (🔥✅ Includes important concepts)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#🎥✨_Video_Solution_by_Scholars_Foundation_➡️_(Easy-to-Understand_💡✔️)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">🎥✨ Video Solution by Scholars Foundation ➡️ (Easy-to-Understand 💡✔️)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4_by_Ani_lytical\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4 by Ani_lytical</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f73d811eca6419d9c9a27423331d71ff06eb957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> have arithmetic mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/353c50518298ebe991034ce55dd96a74d6753878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2, b^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b693026c70424da68ed4c52d3d0d35d9548ee4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^2$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe92b28c7e96df2981562af451b2b2f45b8b6c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab, ac,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe207dd510fa3e2012d9747d93de6f9cc71bf3f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc$\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc7fc8fffc609914709caa8529f831dd2f4ead38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } -\\dfrac{10}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } -\\dfrac{10}{9} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } \\dfrac{10}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"461\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefbdc4dce4cfbbf71d8f13bcd98eb5726d17bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b+c}{3} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"39\" />, that means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e4c3e85710cff4f69bfec2adaff5ea38111a3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b970a85a5cba76671a63354ebe4832d51d3d4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+c)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"21\" />. Expanding that gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/1/d11d0a9c4e46eb4fc0e41f9a7c603cfd8b704126.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b+c)^2=a^2+b^2+c^2+2ab+2ac+2bc=0\\]\" width=\"383\" height=\"20\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b619eeeb63acb04ebf1dac02ea768bd59bc897c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2+b^2+c^2}{3} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"140\" height=\"41\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3edf7085338a7bb395437588db6f13da0c4aa4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3025c9aeef3312efbb3c9a7d875019e36393c9cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[30 + 2ab + 2ac + 2bc = 0\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"14\" /> Basic arithmetic will give you that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/3/e4346f76626c762c1cac987c84bf7188e23abfb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + bc + ac = -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />. To find the arithmetic mean, divide that by 3, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f7d9795364c7108c2ca837e07d262a7e5e6aa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ab + bc + ac}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }-5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>~ARay10 [Feel free to clean this up!]\n</p><p>~Mr.Lightning [Cleaned it up a bit]\n</p><p>~small edits by RoyalPawn38\n~small edit by OrangeRedBlue\n</p><p>~Small edit by Karthi_Pal\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5969c2cfb1ffadf981fbbddcf796c8eb0037546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0b172cf0bcfd01fe2934adcc4c30470a9ef868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />. Since we know that the arithmetic mean of the three numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3edf7085338a7bb395437588db6f13da0c4aa4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. Using this equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e3d83eeb75568da4e2ec6bf0be7ea71366946f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} + b^{2} = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e206ec4f817471e4332cb96560e6e28d824553b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />. Observe that taking the positive or negative root won't matter as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> will be the opposite. If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/6/3d657ced3b46af70e1a3d1b3b595891e4cea2240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\sqrt{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69ba86d6e783da02c4ba178feebf7f23bac96730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = -\\sqrt{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64e12932aed949f4088103b423d7ed307f7d12ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 0\\times\\sqrt{15} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21a6e260fa80fdb1cf482785d98c6e5eac69b1a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ac = 0\\times-\\sqrt{15} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/157d6f6edff19fa2a64d3f37adb1141e94c776d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc = \\sqrt{15}\\times-\\sqrt{15} = -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"201\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9eb9211f2a0c0f452865578b51b9f876542139f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+ac+bc=-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />. Doing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/9035eff011d69ec52138307f79fe426ba7d12eee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-15}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" /> to get the arithmetic mean will give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/4/66442aede8c84aa50253fa1451bf2fb19ea71f23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ -5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-aleyang\n</p><p>~unpogged (cleaned it up, fixed some errors)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28interesting_property.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(interesting_property)\">Solution 4 (interesting property)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (interesting property)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the definition of arithmetic means and some simple manipulation, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e4c3e85710cff4f69bfec2adaff5ea38111a3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3edf7085338a7bb395437588db6f13da0c4aa4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/4836fd1e4e7e2fc47b51ca5483962dd591c644ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab+ac+bc=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />, we have: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/b/bbb05a433bf9234590ac2748dd5b3aea1567d750.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[k=ab+ac+bc=(a+b)c+ab\\]\" width=\"254\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c7766cf38352105f41c478a9e4af1b44e09d40c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=-(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> into the expression, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/256836ca8567e2e1c9b65c3f7e79ed3d1d30ed60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-c^2+ab=k\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Adding twice the equation above to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3edf7085338a7bb395437588db6f13da0c4aa4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2+c^2=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/9720ba891f1bcdfd20ddbc23542b9b038f35c4d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2+c^2-2c^2+2ab=30+2k\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178948500d02d3073350d4c5c90839c07762aaa1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2+2ab-c^2=30+2k\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b0629abd7f2995176dba4d40ca54426e568d47af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b)^2-c^2=30+2k\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f862bd7aa9d7cac6b86198f2b4a5ad9d421c6f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b+c)(a+b-c)=30+2k\\]\" width=\"249\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>But we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e4c3e85710cff4f69bfec2adaff5ea38111a3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad630d66cf78821ab5e8f1e998912403ffc9b306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30+2k=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5adb144c638ab7d9f29b9fac620ed9a6bff1a1d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/8/f68ac45953f5feedc4b43c449a6ccaff1cad8467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab,ac,bc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394da76b4d928e6b40d42dab274e582203bbb2c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k}{3}=-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"39\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/4/66442aede8c84aa50253fa1451bf2fb19ea71f23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ -5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:IDKHowtoaddsolution&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:IDKHowtoaddsolution (page does not exist)\">IDKHowtoaddsolution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Number_Craft_.28.F0.9F.94.A5.E2.9C.85_Includes_important_concepts.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Number_Craft_(🔥✅_Includes_important_concepts)\">Video Solution by Number Craft (🔥✅ Includes important concepts)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Number Craft (🔥✅ Includes important concepts)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"